            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Retrieve ਪਹਿਲਾ, then ਕਮਰਾ, then ਕਮਰੇ ਵਿੱਚ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "grammar",
          "title": "Grammar Lens: direct owner",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਪਹਿਲਾ ਕਮਰਾ — pahilā kamrā — the first room."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਪਹਿਲੇ ਕਮਰੇ ਵਿੱਚ — pahile kamre vicc — in the first room."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The familiar direct form has the final -aa sound. In this masculine singular phrase, the noun is oblique before ਵਿੱਚ, and the ordinal takes final -e."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "grammar",
          "title": "Grammar Lens: source boundary",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Gill and Gleason's masculine adjective table contrasts the singular direct and singular oblique patterns. Here that contrast is ਪਹਿਲਾ beside ਪਹਿਲੇ (pahile). Their following numeral section lists first ਪਹਿਲਾ and second ਦੂਜਾ among Punjabi ordinals. This chapter follows these two ordinals, not a claim that every Punjabi adjective changes this way. Source: Harjeet Singh Gill and Henry A. Gleason, Jr., A Reference Grammar of Punjabi (1969), pp. 71–73, adjectives and numerals."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "HEAR",
              "instruction": "pahilaa kamraa; YOU SAY: ਪਹਿਲਾ ਕਮਰਾ",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU HEAR: *pahilaa kamraa*; YOU SAY: **ਪਹਿਲਾ ਕਮਰਾ**]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "HEAR",
              "instruction": "pahile kamre vich; YOU SAY: ਪਹਿਲੇ ਕਮਰੇ ਵਿੱਚ",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU HEAR: *pahile kamre vich*; YOU SAY: **ਪਹਿਲੇ ਕਮਰੇ ਵਿੱਚ**]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "READ",
              "instruction": "ਪਹਿਲਾ ਕਮਰਾ, ਪਹਿਲੇ (pahile) ਕਮਰੇ ਵਿੱਚ",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU READ: **ਪਹਿਲਾ ਕਮਰਾ · ਪਹਿਲੇ ਕਮਰੇ ਵਿੱਚ**]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "WRITE",
              "instruction": "copy ਪਹਿਲੇ (pahile) once, then compare it with ਪਹਿਲਾ",
              "spoken": false,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU WRITE: copy **ਪਹਿਲੇ** once, then compare it with **ਪਹਿਲਾ**]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
